    (uuid 89752573-4e69-4ac7-83aa-6e1f3e73a7be))
  (text "Set the module CV pot to 4.25 V with no load BEFORE wiring the FB tap. That pot value is the hardware voltage ceiling."
    (at 25 110.0 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27))
      (justify left top))
    (uuid 9a2019f1-17f6-4e44-8d43-708ceb249e6e))
  (text "DAC #2 (0x61) injects current into the XL4016 FB pin (1.25 V) through D401 + R401. Injection can only LOWER the output, so DAC = 0 / MCU dead = 4.25 V ceiling, never higher."
    (at 25 114.5 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27))
      (justify left top))
    (uuid 8257332c-1869-4243-ad5b-7a07f5c1b44e))
  (text "With the module bottom FB resistor ~360 Ohm and top ~860 Ohm: DAC 0 V -> 4.25 V, DAC 3.3 V -> ~3.0 V. Measure your module and adjust R401."
    (at 25 119.0 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27))
      (justify left top))
    (uuid 28984009-af8b-4bf8-b12d-6dc5dd10ddd1))
  (text "The module own CC shunt is bypassed because IN- and OUT- share system GND. Turn its CC pot to max; current is regulated by firmware (ADS1115 + shunt) and limited by the OC comparator."
    (at 25 123.5 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27))
      (justify left top))
    (uuid c6d04ef9-a77c-47a9-9bc5-46f855d115bc))
  (text "Firmware CC/CV: lower/raise the DAC until measured current = target, then hold 4.2 V and stop at C/20 by opening K1."
    (at 25 128.0 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27))
      (justify left top))
    (uuid b603a779-c734-43e9-868d-f228b6d55da1)))
